meta {
  name: Space List Spaces
  type: http
  seq: 144
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/xrpc/com.atproto.space.listSpaces?limit=50
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

params:query {
  limit: 50
  ~type: org.example.bucket
  ~did: did:plc:authorityaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
  ~cursor:
}

docs {
  The spaces the authenticated account holds a repo in — spaces it has *written to*. This
  is deliberately not "spaces I am a member of": a member's PDS only ever learns about a
  space by storing a repo in it.

  Optional "type" and "did" narrow to a space type / authority DID. With no filters, an
  OAuth caller needs a wildcard "space:" grant; narrowing the query narrows what the grant
  has to cover. The cursor is the last space URI of a full page; a short page ends the walk.
}
